        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What the freak is with that tree up in the air?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Company Representative"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are only a few days until the exhibition! How many stands does that thing take up? Rhine Lab didn't apply for upper-level exhibition rights!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Company Representative"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhine and the ATAO must be colluding! I saw Gordon Tannen on that tree that night!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Company Representative"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gustave, former ATAO Director, promised in a broadcast that he'd have an explanation the next morning. And what actually happened?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Company Representative"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not one word from the committee! I bet they're stalling for time!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Company Representative"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "f",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1041_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.8,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Please remain patient.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Staff"
    },
    {
        "text": "The credibility of the Propeller Paradise administration and engineering departments is at stake here. We need to deal with this carefully and come up with a plan that can satisfy the hundreds of corporations that have an interest in the project.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Staff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's asking you to deal with it carefully?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Company Representative"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1041_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Staff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who gives a crap? It's not like this is another Ring Lab.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Company Representative"
    },
    {
        "text": "The engineering department's inspections have stopped, and the administration's vetting is over. Who cares if Propeller Paradise officials are doing their jobs or not?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Company Representative"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1041_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the hearing is a necessary part of the oversight process...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Staff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Investigations and trials, those are your problem. We just want to know the result of the hearing\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Company Representative"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Air Expo Columbia we expected to make a splash in Columbia and even all of Terra\u2014is it gonna happen or not?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Company Representative"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
