    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Out of the way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Propeller Paradise Police"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#7$1",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#7$1",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "0,-80",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 0.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_sit_tatami",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I said, out of the way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Propeller Paradise Police"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You really think that sitting here puts your illegal equipment out of our reach?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Propeller Paradise Police"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "It remains Rhine Lab property until the hearing is underway. Besides, what are you calling 'illegal equipment'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't you recognize a floating botanical unit when you see it? The saplings floating around you are no different from the one behind us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You insolent little... I need more men over here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Propeller Paradise Police"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "300,0",
        "posto": "30,0",
        "duration": 1.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "-300,0",
        "posto": "-30,0",
        "duration": 1.2,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_529_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Sky, we don't have the numbers. We can only hold out for so long, if they decide to use force.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Researcher"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, we don't know whether this tree-like device behind us is legal, or whether it's safe. After all, it's only been two years since Control Wright...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Researcher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#7$1",
        "posfrom": "0,-80",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll ask you one question. As a scientist, are you willing to just hand over the product of Director Lunorey's sweat and blood?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_529_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "No, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Researcher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then take action. Leave no regrets.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "If only we had more people. But Rhine only has so many people on Propeller Paradise...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you forget that we're Rhine Lab people too, Mr. Jagger?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2044_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.2,
        "isblock": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2045_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.2,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't want to drag you into this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2044_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2045_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "You're worried about the hearing? Hah, it's not like we haven't seen our share of trumped-up charges.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tester B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those guards wouldn't have gotten onto this platform if you called us sooner.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tester A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bunch of slumslugs trying to play the hero?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Propeller Paradise Police"
    },
    {
        "text": "Possession of illegal equipment, destruction of property, aiding and abetting... there's enough to keep all of you locked away for years!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Propeller Paradise Police"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2044_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2045_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd already be locked away if Director Lunorey didn't take me in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tester B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You wanna touch the tree, you have to go through us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tester A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't threaten me with a good time!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Propeller Paradise Police"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhine researchers and testers form a wall against the guards attempting to enter, while curious onlookers on the outside look up at the towering 'tree'."
    },
    {
        "text": "A tall, dark figure walks past the rear of the crowd, footsteps clanking."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_woodfloor_fts",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2038_1#5$1",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.7,
        "duration": 0.8,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "So... this is Rhine's 'tree'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
