    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_telephone",
        "channel": "phone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2037_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's an honor to see you here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mercia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, you flatter me, Mercia. I've been on an extended holiday and it's about time I got back in the saddle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2037_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you here for the hearing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mercia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. The design of the Maylander Emergency Management Council badge is pretty nice. You should try one on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2037_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is my mission over?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mercia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our mission has only just started.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2037_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are your orders?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mercia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "No rush. These past few days have been quite eventful. Other than Nasti and Gordon Tannen, are there any other stories that I should hear?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2037_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mercia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "See you at the ropeway station in five minutes. There's so much going on with Propeller Paradise that I'm sure I'll need a local guide.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2037_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mercia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_telephone",
        "channel": "phone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.8
    },
    {
        "text": "(Broken muttering)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "V\u00e6la"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_highheeledshoe_carpet_fts",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2037_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "200,0",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1.2,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, I should have closed the window.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mercia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Company reps and testers are protesting on the streets. The longer the hearing takes, the more restless they get.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mercia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_openwindow",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
