    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$ponder_intro",
        "key": "$ponder_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1000_1#3$1",
        "duration": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1",
        "duration": 0.8,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1000_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're in jail again! They didn't even bother to change our cell!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oakley"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1000_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The time of the hearing keeps changing... you think they might be looking for more evidence and stack even more charges on us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oakley"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1000_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look, if they ask, I'm telling the truth that you're the impostor!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oakley"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1000_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come on, say something, you're scaring me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oakley"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know, nomadic prisons on the barrenlands could become tourist attractions. The only problem is that it's much easier to get in than out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1000_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're still thinking about tours at a time like this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oakley"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1000_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've already lost one client, and now you're putting your other one in jail?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oakley"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll find her. And there's no need for you to worry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1000_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "How do you figure?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oakley"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No trial, no ID check, no notice to appear... you think the guards are just stalling for time to find a way to charge us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1000_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oakley"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't think so. I think it's a sign\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You and I are not the focus of this hearing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
