    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#9$1",
        "duration": 0.8
    },
    {
        "text": "Ferne and Oakley are in jail. Merry hasn't been seen since last night. All the phone lines at the registrar are busy. Everyone and their Originium slugs are looking for me and Nasti.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's time I put what I learned from the old man into practice. I'll have an answer for everything. I have nothing to fear!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like the old fox has lost his touch. No one's come to interrogate me yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait a second!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_devicebeep",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew... alright, I still show up as the chief executive of Propeller Paradise on the terminal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2040_1#1$3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Beep\u2014'Sky Conqueror' is currently under excessive stress. Please remember your health. We are on a long journey that leads beyond Terra.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Space Finbeast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dammit, are they gonna start that hearing or not? Everything would be over and done with if I were in charge! That old coot just keeps tripping me up. It's been this way for seven years!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why haven't you gotten one bit better in the past seven years?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gustave...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
