    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_woodfloor_fts",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2042_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2042_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "How would YOU do it, if you were in charge?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gustave"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2042_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You thought you could pat yourself on the back for stopping the Rhine inspections, thinking you could continue to run your little hustle worry-free...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gustave"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2042_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you think ATAO was, a kindergarten? Is that how you ended up this naive?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gustave"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everything would have gone smoothly if not for that bloody tree! This is all Nasti's fault!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2042_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Smoothly? Even a junior assistant under Nasti saw through your tricks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gustave"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2042_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The whole country would've seen your dirty laundry if he weren't every bit as naive as you, so much that he came to me for help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gustave"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2042_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "So tell me, how do you plan on dealing with it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gustave"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Please... help me... sir...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2042_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph. Whatever the reason Rhine had to build this floating unit, we can't let them continue to define their own creations.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gustave"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2042_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The administration should have had full authority over this, but it has been excluded from the assessment, thanks to your incompetence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gustave"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean, we'll need a third party?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2042_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "A scientific consultant who is objective, professional, with the appearance of impartiality.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gustave"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_woodfloor_fts",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2038_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "-200,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 2,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Tannen. It's a pleasure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scientific Consultant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2042_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "He doesn't look like a scientific consultant at all... can he really handle this Rhine stuff?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2038_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I visited the floating platform in order to familiarize myself with the assessment subject.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scientific Consultant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2038_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's certainly an impressive 'tree'. And there was plenty of activity in its shade.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scientific Consultant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
