        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Over our cold, dead bodies!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2044_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Mr. Jagger...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tester"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Just bluffing.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did radiation from beyond the Starpod fry your brain or something? You really want to bleed for this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Propeller Paradise Police"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll get your wish, then!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Propeller Paradise Police"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_woodfloor_fts",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2046_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2046_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.8,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That uniform... you're with Maylander?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Propeller Paradise Police"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2046_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2046_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "We are with the Maylander Foundation's Emergency Management Council. According to the bylaws of Propeller Paradise, the Council has the authority to take over all administrative and management functions in the event of an accident or disaster.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Council Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can check with Gordon Tannen and Gustave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Council Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Propeller Paradise Police"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#5$1",
        "posfrom": "80,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 0.8,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Emergency Management Council?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2046_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, Mr. Jagger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Council Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "We understand your position, but we advise you to avoid any reckless actions. We are authorized to take extraordinary measures against you and your colleagues, if necessary.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Council Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So Propeller Paradise is in a state of emergency, and your preliminary investigation has defined yesterday's event as a\u2014'special incident'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2046_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. The Council has established a special investigation team to obtain evidence from the scene and persons of interest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Council Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "The investigation is ongoing. A hearing is the only fair and just course of action, in the absence of an official judicial institution. We thank you for your patience.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Council Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Does Rhine keep possession of this 'floating botanical unit' until the hearing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2046_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Council Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope your investigation is as fair and just as the conclusion you just reached.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2046_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is no need to worry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Council Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2046_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The safety of the temporary floating platform has been ensured. Bravo is resuming patrol.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Council Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
