        "time": 1.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "focus": "l",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Are we just gonna leave, Mr. Jagger?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tester"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maylander's authority looks real, judging from the reaction of the guards.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The hearing keeps getting delayed, and things are still in flux. We won't learn anything if we stay here. Besides...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have any of you seen Director Lunorey?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
